# GnuCash test files
*.gnucash
*.gnucash.LCK
*.gnucash.log
# Sample books ship with the repo — exempt them from the global
# ``*.gnucash`` ignore so they're tracked. Personal books outside
# ``samples/`` remain ignored.
!samples/*.gnucash

# ...but the *generated* books are regenerable from the build_*.py
# scripts (+ market_data_cache.json), so they and their auto-backup /
# .mcp sidecars are NOT committed. The scripts + cache are the source
# of truth; run ``uv run python scripts/synthetic_book/build_*.py`` to
# rebuild. (Later rules override the re-include above.)
samples/*.generated.gnucash
samples/*.generated.gnucash.*
samples/*.gnucash.mcp/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code local-only notes (cross-session handoffs, personal context).
# The committed CLAUDE.md is the public contributor guide.
CLAUDE.local.md

# Local-only working files — IDE / client state, scratch notes,
# local test scripts that shouldn't pollute the shared repo.
.claude/
.mcp.json
ERROR_TESTING.md
test.sh
